# Project 1 KPI Tree: Online Retail Sales

## Main question
How is the online retail business performing, and which products, countries, and customers contribute most to sales?

## KPI tree

Online retail business performance
├── How much did the business sell?
│   └── Revenue = quantity × price, summed across items
├── How many orders were placed?
│   └── Number of unique invoice numbers
├── What was the average order value?
│   └── Average order value = revenue ÷ number of orders
├── Which products performed best?
│   ├── Units sold by product
│   └── Revenue by product
├── Which countries had the highest sales?
│   └── Revenue by country
└── Are customers returning?
    └── Repeat-customer rate = customers with more than one order ÷ all customers

